Extent Reports:
 --> third-party opensource HTML report library for Java to integrate with Selenium to generate interactive, static automation report.

Components :
    1. ExtentSparkReporter
        --> configure the HTML file path,document title, custom themes(DARK/WHITE), generate the GUI
    2. ExtentReports
        --> Report specifications or common infomrations regarding the reports --> attaches the spark reporter
    3. Extenttest
        --> step wise test logs, status (pass/fail/skip) and attach screenshots